Key:         im.message.created_v1
Description: 监听指定资源上的新消息创建事件；必须结合模板使用
Event:       im.message.created_v1

Required Scopes:
  - event:subscription:read
  - event:subscription:write

Refined Subscription: yes
Resource Type: im.message
Conditional Scopes:
  - event:encrypt_key:read (when --include-resource-data set with --as user)
Risk: ordinary read, effective write — refined consume may create, reuse, reactivate, or bind remote resources (dry-run recommended)
Payload Options: --include-resource-data (include_resource_data default: false)
Dry Run: supported — lark-cli event subscription create im.message.created_v1/chat-id/oc_9f3b1c2d8a --dry-run --json
Next Action: run `lark-cli event subscription create im.message.created_v1/chat-id/oc_9f3b1c2d8a --dry-run --json` before consume
Filter: supported — --filter (optional, json); logic and/or; operators eq/in/contains; max depth 2, max conditions 10, max bytes 1024
  - sender: eq (open_id)
  - message_type: eq/in [list<=10]

Output Schema:
  {
    "type": "object",
    "description": "meta-swap placeholder: minimal mock output schema for im.message.created_v1, pending the fetch_meta-driven refined catalog (design spec section 2.2). Not the final resolved_output_schema.",
    "properties": {
      "message_id": {
        "type": "string",
        "description": "Message ID; placeholder mock field only"
      }
    }
  }
